+    "Spec is tight (every flagged concern closed by the panel or the owner, acceptance measurable), but the blast radius is wide: 9 app modules rewritten or deleted, the public frame contract loses three columns, BinanceBanError, the um market and the 1s interval, and the cache moves to a new subtree.",
